  "title": "TWFG Expands Credit Facility to $125 Million, Enhancing Capacity for Continued Growth and Strategic Investments",
  "summary": "THE WOODLANDS, Texas, Aug. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TWFG, Inc. (Nasdaq: TWFG) (\"TWFG\" or the \"Company\") today announced that it has entered into an Amended and Restated Credit Agreement providing for a $125 million revolving credit facility and extending the facility's maturity to August 12,",
